StatefulSet+Storage Class ---> called as Dynamic Provisioning ?


Example: 1. StorageClass.yaml


apiVersion: storage.k8s.io/v1
kind: StorageClass
metadata:
  name: mysql-ebs-pv-0
provisioner: ebs.csi.aws.com
volumeBindingMode: WaitForFirstConsumer
reclaimPolicy: Retain
parameters:
  type: gp3
  fsType: ext4
  iops: "6000"             # Recommended: 2x default (good for DB & web apps)
  throughput: "250" 


NOTE : this droiver need to be  install
kubectl apply -k "github.com/kubernetes-sigs/aws-ebs-csi-driver/deploy/kubernetes/overlays/stable/ecr/?ref=release-1.28"


NOTE: AWS ke liye provisioner: kubernetes.io/aws-ebs valid hai (legacy), but latest versions may use:
provisioner: ebs.csi.aws.com

Agar aap GCP ya Azure use kar rahe ho, toh provisioner accordingly change karna hoga:

GCP: kubernetes.io/gce-pd

Azure: kubernetes.io/azure-disk ya disk.csi.azure.com



Example: 2. StatefulSet for StorageClass.yaml


apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: StatefulSet
metadata:
  name: mysql
spec:
  serviceName: "mysql"
  replicas: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: mysql
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: mysql
    spec:
      initContainers:
      - name: mysql-cleanup
        image: busybox
        command: ["sh", "-c", "rm -rf /var/lib/mysql/*"]
        volumeMounts:
        - name: mysql-sc-pvc
          mountPath: /var/lib/mysql
      containers:
        - name: mysql
          image: mysql:5.7
          env:
            - name: MYSQL_DATABASE
              valueFrom:
                configMapKeyRef:
                  name: mysql-configmaps
                  key: database
            - name: MYSQL_USERNAME
              valueFrom:
                secretKeyRef:
                  name: mysql-secrets
                  key: username
            - name: MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD
              valueFrom:
                secretKeyRef:
                  name: mysql-secrets
                  key: password
          ports:
            - containerPort: 3306
          volumeMounts:
            - name: mysql-pvc-0
              mountPath: "/var/lib/mysql"
  volumeClaimTemplates:
    - metadata:
        name: mysql-pvc-0
      spec:
        accessModes:
          - ReadWriteOnce
        resources:
          requests:
            storage: 5Gi
        storageClassName: mysql-ebs-pv-0




Note : the PVCs are automatically created by volumeClaimTemplates in the StatefulSet and we define volume in StatefulSet for security due to
Storage Class and we define storageClassName in StatefulSet for storage class

